{"title": "Levitate (Illithid Power)", "pageid": 20550, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Levitate_(Illithid_Power)", "categories": ["Class actions", "Movement-expending actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">This article is about the full-illithid power. For the partial-illithid version, see <a href=\"/wiki/Fly_(Illithid_Power)\" title=\"Fly (Illithid Power)\">Fly (Illithid Power)</a>.   </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Fly_Illithid_Power.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Fly_Illithid_Power.webp/300px-Fly_Illithid_Power.webp, /w/images/a/ae/Fly_Illithid_Power.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Fly_Illithid_Power.webp/300px-Fly_Illithid_Power.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Fly_Illithid_Power.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Levitate</b> is a movement action and <a href=\"/wiki/Illithid_power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Illithid power\">illithid power</a> available to <a href=\"/wiki/Full-Illithid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Full-Illithid\">Full-Illithids</a> and other <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_flayer\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mind flayer\">mind flayers</a>. It allows them to fly to distant location with a small, fixed movement cost.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nFloat effortlessly to a destination.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/9/97/Movement_Speed_Icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/9/97/Movement_Speed_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> 4 m (13 ft) <a href=\"/wiki/Resources#Movement_speed\" title=\"Resources\">Movement Speed</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 18 m (60 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 18 m (60 ft)</dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UIDs</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Projectile_Levitate_Mindflayer_Player</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Projectile_Levitate_Mindflayer_Player\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Projectile_Levitate_Mindflayer_Player\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span> Version available in full-illithid form</div><code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Projectile_Levitate_Mindflayer</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Projectile_Levitate_Mindflayer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Projectile_Levitate_Mindflayer\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span> Version used by mind flayer NPCs with a once-per-turn restriction</div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=CannotTargetCharacter_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"CannotTargetCharacter (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">CannotTargetCharacter</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=CannotTargetItems_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"CannotTargetItems (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">CannotTargetItems</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasHighGroundRangeExtension_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasHighGroundRangeExtension (spell flag)\">HasHighGroundRangeExtension</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IgnoreVisionBlock_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IgnoreVisionBlock (spell flag)\">IgnoreVisionBlock</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/Invisible_(spell_flag)\" title=\"Invisible (spell flag)\">Invisible</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsJump_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsJump (spell flag)\">IsJump</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=NoAOEDamageOnLand_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"NoAOEDamageOnLand (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">NoAOEDamageOnLand</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=RangeIgnoreVerticalThreshold_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"RangeIgnoreVerticalThreshold (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">RangeIgnoreVerticalThreshold</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/Stealth_(spell_flag)\" title=\"Stealth (spell flag)\">Stealth</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Full-Illithid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Full-Illithid\">Full-Illithid</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Flayer\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mind Flayer\">Mind Flayer</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Omeluum\" title=\"Omeluum\">Omeluum</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/The_Emperor\" title=\"The Emperor\">The Emperor</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Illithid_Arcanist\" title=\"Illithid Arcanist\">Illithid Arcanist</a>\n</p>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Partial-Illithids have the similar ability <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fly_(Illithid_Power)\" title=\"Fly (Illithid Power)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/06/Fly_Illithid_Power_Icon.webp/20px-Fly_Illithid_Power_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/06/Fly_Illithid_Power_Icon.webp/30px-Fly_Illithid_Power_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/06/Fly_Illithid_Power_Icon.webp/40px-Fly_Illithid_Power_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fly\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/06/Fly_Illithid_Power_Icon.webp/20px-Fly_Illithid_Power_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/06/Fly_Illithid_Power_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fly_(Illithid_Power)\" title=\"Fly (Illithid Power)\">Fly</a>. This upgraded version has a fixed <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Movement_Speed_Icon.png/23px-Movement_Speed_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/9/97/Movement_Speed_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Movement_Speed_Icon.png/23px-Movement_Speed_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/9/97/Movement_Speed_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Resources#Movement_speed\" title=\"Resources\">Movement Speed</a> cost that does not scale with distance travelled.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715044130\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.057 